  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for 200 homeless youths in Bangkok</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Every month more than 200 children and youths living on the streets of Bangkok depend on Childline Thailand Foundation (CTF) for basic needs support. CTF provides services through our harm reduction shelter &apos;the Hub&apos; and offers daily meals, showers, a safe space to rest and access to health services, counselling, education and life skills. Situated in the heart of Bangkok, the Hub has been helping children in street situations for 10 years.</narrative>
  </description>
